4.divRemWith_spec","kind":"theorem","line":69,"name":"MPN.W64.divRemWith_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN64/Div/Basecase.lean#L69-L150"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.divRemWith\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">divRemWith</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./MPN64/Arch/UIntArray.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array.USlice\">ScalarArray.UInt64Array.USlice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array\">ScalarArray.UInt64Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt64/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt64Array\">ScalarArray.UInt64Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`(a / b, a % b)`, the quotient in `a.size - b.size + 1` limbs and the remainder in `b.size` limbs,\nlike GMP's `mpn_tdiv_qr`. It requires `0 < b.size ≤ a.size` and a nonzero top limb of `b`. A\ndivisor of one limb uses `divRem1`; a longer one `main`'s `Schoolbook.divRemN`, which normalizes\nit, like GMP: `a` and `b` are shifted left by the `k` bits that set the top bit of `b`, which keeps\nthe corrections of the estimates rare, and the remainder is shifted back at the end.","docLink":"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.divRemWith","kind":"def","line":50,"name":"MPN.W64.divRemWith","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN64/Div/Basecase.lean#L50-L67"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.div2RowsU\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2RowsU</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`config.div2Rows` as a `USize`, at most `2³² - 1`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.div2RowsU","kind":"def","line":45,"name":"MPN.W64.div2RowsU","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN64/Div/Basecase.lean#L45-L46"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.div32RecipU\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">div32RecipU</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`config.div32Recip` as a `USize`, at most `2³² - 1`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.div32RecipU","kind":"def","line":42,"name":"MPN.W64.div32RecipU","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN64/Div/Basecase.lean#L42-L43"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.recip32\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W64</span>.<span class=\"name\">recip32</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">d₀</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The reciprocal `⌊(β³ - 1) / (d₁ β + d₀)⌋ - β` of a normalized `d₁ β + d₀`, like GMP's\n`invert_pi1`, by `main`'s `WordArray.recip32`.","docLink":"./MPN64/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.W64.recip32","kind":"def","line":38,"name":"MPN.W64.recip32","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN64/Div/Basecase.lean#L38-L40"}}],"imports":["Init","MPN.Div.Basecase","MPN64.Div.Limb"],"instances":[],"name":"MPN64.Div.Basecase"}